            <sparkle:version>12</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>New Boards: drag clips onto boards and arrange them freely (⇧⌘B)</li>
<li>Notes on boards, with headers and any colour; right-click a board to add one</li>
<li>Save any board note to your clip history</li>
<li>A quick tour of what's new after each update</li>
<li>New glass app icon and menu bar icon</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
