            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>New glass buttons in place of coloured ones</li>
<li>Selected clips are highlighted in blue glass, in List and Cards</li>
<li>Clippy now follows your Mac's accent colour instead of purple</li>
<li>Clicking a YouTube thumbnail on a card now selects the clip</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
